<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<!--
  Race card speeds (D079 amendment, card subheaders, 2026-11-06). A race
  card's subheader reads "Size · Speed · Vision", which holds only short
  fields of steady size; every race's Speed is "6 squares" or similar
  except the Pixie's, whose authored Speed carried a rule sentence (119
  characters): "4 squares, fly 6 squares (altitude limit 1). You cannot
  use this fly speed if you are carrying more than a normal load." Its
  speed now names a racial trait, "4 squares, fly 6 (Limited Flight)", and
  the Limited Flight trait states both limits (owner decision,
  2026-11-06): the altitude limit as the race's own Special Rules word it,
  and the load limit from the authored Speed. Every Pixie gets the trait
  from ID_INTERNAL_GRANTS_PIXIE, after its stock grants, and the race's
  "Racial Traits" list names it last, as the stock traits are granted and
  listed. The Speed specific is display text only: the evaluated Speed
  comes from the race's statadd. The trait is a record the old builder
  doesn't have (D091). A grant is derived at evaluation, never stored, so a
  .dnd4e export writes it only in the regenerated CharacterSheet tally, which
  the old builder rebuilds on save; the level tree it loads from holds the
  stock Pixie grants alone. Merged after the CBLoader parts by
  scripts/build-private-content.sh.
-->
<D20Rules game-system="D&amp;D4E">

  <!-- Pixie (Heroes of the Feywild, CBLoader 06-races.part). -->
  <RemoveNodes internal-id="ID_FMP_RACE_61"><specific name="Speed" /><specific name="Racial Traits" /></RemoveNodes>
  <AppendNodes internal-id="ID_FMP_RACE_61">
    <specific name="Speed">4 squares, fly 6 (Limited Flight)</specific>
    <specific name="Racial Traits"> ID_FMP_RACIAL_TRAIT_641, ID_FMP_RACIAL_TRAIT_4119, ID_FMP_RACIAL_TRAIT_4120, ID_FMP_RACIAL_TRAIT_4121, ID_4ECB_RACIAL_TRAIT_LIMITED_FLIGHT </specific>
  </AppendNodes>
  <AppendNodes internal-id="ID_INTERNAL_GRANTS_PIXIE">
    <rules>
      <grant name="ID_4ECB_RACIAL_TRAIT_LIMITED_FLIGHT" type="Racial Trait" />
    </rules>
  </AppendNodes>
  <RulesElement name="Limited Flight" type="Racial Trait" internal-id="ID_4ECB_RACIAL_TRAIT_LIMITED_FLIGHT" source="Heroes of the Feywild">
    <specific name="Short Description"> You fall if you end your turn more than 1 square up, and can't fly carrying more than a normal load. </specific>
    <specific name="Level"> 1 </specific>
    <specific name="Class"> ID_FMP_RACE_61 </specific>
You have an altitude limit of 1 with your racial fly speed: you fall at the end of your turn if you are using it and are more than 1 square above the ground. You cannot use your racial fly speed while you are carrying more than a normal load.
  </RulesElement>
</D20Rules>
